== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From {{gen}} of ''[[vandi]]'' "[[trouble]]" (= ''[[vanda]]'', "of trouble") + ''[[mál]]'' meaning "[[matter]]" or "[[issue]]". Literally meaning "matter of trouble" or "issue of trouble".
=== Noun ===
'''vandamál''' {{n}}

# [[problem]]
#* [[vera#Icelandic|Er]] [[eitthvað#Icelandic|eitthvað]] '''vandamál'''?
#*: [[be#Icelandic|Is]] [[there]] a '''problem'''?
# [[bother]]
#* ''Já já, [[ég#Icelandi|ég]] [[geta#Icelandic|get]] [[alveg]] [[sækja#Icelandic|sótt]] [[þú#Icelandic|þig]]. [[það#Icelandic|Það]] [[vera#Icelandic|er]] [[ekkert#Icelandic|ekkert]] '''vandamál'''.''
#*: Yea [[sure]], I [[can]] [[pick up|pick you up]]. It's no '''bother'''.

